# PROVISIONAL — CANON REVIEW REQUIRED
~ start
=> hub

~ hub
Korrath Ninefold: If you have a command, give it.
- "You keep asking me to prove every command." [if not QuestRegistry.is_active(QuestRegistry.KORRATH_QUEST) and not QuestRegistry.is_done(QuestRegistry.KORRATH_QUEST) /]
	do QuestRegistry.offer(QuestRegistry.KORRATH_QUEST)
	Korrath Ninefold: I ask for a proven leader. A command is where proof matters.
	Korrath Ninefold: Decide what you expect when I think yours is wrong. Then come back.
	=> hub
- "What should happen when you dispute an order?" [if QuestRegistry.is_active(QuestRegistry.KORRATH_QUEST) and not GameState.get_flag("party_korrath_ninefold_resolved") /]
	Korrath Ninefold: Do I challenge you before anyone moves, or carry the command and question it after?
	Korrath Ninefold: Both can prove a leader. Only one can be our rule.
	- "Challenge me before we move. A leader who cannot answer should not hide behind urgency." [#consequence=Korrath will demand an answer before carrying a disputed command.]
		do QuestRegistry.resolve_companion_quest("korrath-ninefold", QuestRegistry.KORRATH_QUEST, 6.0, "Told Korrath to challenge a disputed command before acting")
		Korrath Ninefold: Then answer plainly when I ask. I will do the same.
		=> END
	- "Carry it first and challenge me after. A leader is also proven by taking responsibility for the result." [#consequence=Korrath will carry the command, then demand an accounting.]
		do QuestRegistry.resolve_companion_quest("korrath-ninefold", QuestRegistry.KORRATH_QUEST, 6.0, "Told Korrath to carry the command and demand an accounting after")
		Korrath Ninefold: Good. I will follow. I will also remember to ask.
		=> END
- "Later." [if not GameState.get_flag("party_korrath_ninefold_resolved") /]
	=> END
- "The terms are set." [if GameState.get_flag("party_korrath_ninefold_resolved") /]
	Korrath Ninefold: Then prove them when the moment comes.
	=> END
